# GPT AI Film Agent

## Goal
Build a full AI Film Studio with GPT as the main orchestrator and Gemini as a supporting agent.

## Workflow
1. Create film brief
2. Write screenplay
3. Generate storyboard
4. Plan visual and audio direction
5. Build timeline
6. Preview and approve
7. Render and export MP4

## Architecture
- apps/web: Film Studio interface
- apps/api: Backend API and GPT Actions
- apps/worker: Rendering worker
- PostgreSQL: Projects and job metadata
- Queue: Background rendering jobs
- Object storage: Media assets and MP4 files

## Engine
Use LEMO Opuscar as the film production engine.

## AI
- GPT: Main orchestrator
- Gemini: Supporting agent

## Security
Keep all API keys in server-side environment variables.
Never commit secrets.

## Status
Architecture planning stage. Production services and deployment are not yet implemented.
